emampuannya berbahasa Inggris dan Prancis membuatnya luwes bergaul dengan orang-orang dari berbagai bangsa yang datang atau singgah di Kemayoran. Diantara tamu-tamu / undangan tokoh nasional yang pernah dilayani Dini terdapat nama Bung Karno, ketika Presiden RI pertama itu melaksankan perjalanannya bersama Worosilov, pemimpin UniSoviet di kala itu. Dan pertemuan penting lain yang akihirnya mengambil tempat dalam sejarah hidup pribadi Dini ialah dengan Yves Coffin, seorang diplomat berkebangsaan Prancis.',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51223,1565,'650','','0','$a novel -- fiksi',13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51224,1566,'001',NULL,NULL,'INLIS000000000001546',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51225,1566,'005',NULL,NULL,'20251027120749',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51226,1566,'008',NULL,NULL,'251027|||||||||   |   |||   |||| ||   | ',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51227,1566,'020','','','$a 978-979-22-4104-4',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51228,1566,'035','','','0010-1025001546',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51229,1566,'041','','','$a id',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51230,1566,'082','0','','$a NONE',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51231,1566,'090','','','$a FIKSI AHE d',8,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51232,1566,'100','0','','$a Cecilia Ahern',9,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51233,1566,'245','0','0','$a Di Ujung Pelangi',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51234,1566,'250','','','$a 1',11,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51235,1566,'260','','','$a Jakarta $b PT Gramedia Pustaka Utama $c 2009',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51236,1566,'300','','','$a 632 hlm; 18 cm',13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51237,1566,'650','','0','$a novel -- Novel Dewasa',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51238,1567,'001',NULL,NULL,'INLIS000000000001547',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51239,1567,'005',NULL,NULL,'20251027120750',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(51240,1567,'008',NULL,NULL,'251027|||||||||   |   |||   |||| ||   | ',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL