ni alias Mpret, hidup Elektra mulai terakselerasi. Dari anak kuper yang tidak punya motivasi, Elektra bertransformasi menjadi seorang pengusaha, dan akhirnya seorang penyembuh.\r\n\r\nSetelah nyaman dalam lingkungannya yang baru, hidup Elektra kembali siap diguncang ketika Bong memintanya untuk menolong seseorang yang tak ia kenal bernama Bodhi.',13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57210,2015,'650','','0','$a novel -- Sastra -- fiksi',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57211,2016,'001',NULL,NULL,'INLIS000000000001983',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57212,2016,'005',NULL,NULL,'20251027120908',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57213,2016,'008',NULL,NULL,'251027|||||||||   |   |||   |||| ||   | ',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57214,2016,'020','','','$a 9786239554521',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57215,2016,'035','','','0010-1025001983',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57216,2016,'041','','','$a id',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57217,2016,'082','0','','$a 813',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57218,2016,'090','','','$a 813 LIY p',8,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57219,2016,'100','0','','$a Tere Liye',9,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57220,2016,'245','0','0','$a Pulang - Pergi',10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57221,2016,'260','','','$a Depok $b Sabak Grip $c 2020',11,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57222,2016,'300','','','$a 414 hlm; 20 cm',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57223,2016,'500','','','$a Ada jodoh yang ditemukan lewat tatapan pertama. Ada persahabatan yang diawali lewat sapa hangat. Bagaimana jika takdir bersama ternyata, diawali dengan pertarungan mematikan ? Lantas semua cerita berkelindan dengan, pengejaran demi pengejaran mencari jawaban ? Pulang-Pergi .',13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57224,2016,'650','','0','$a novel -- Sastra -- fiksi',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57225,2017,'001',NULL,NULL,'INLIS000000000001984',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(57226,2017,'005',NULL,NULL,'20251027120908',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N