 BAB 3. Teknik Industri Sebagai Cabang Ilmu Kerekayasaan BAB 4. Perancangan Metode Kerja BAB 5. Sistem Produksi BAB 6. Perencanaan Fasilitas BAB 7. Pemrograman Linear BAB 8. Teori Antrean BAB 9. Pemrograman Integer BAB 10. Teori Graph Dan Network BAB 11. Sistem Informasi Manajemen BAB 12. Computer Integrated Design Manufacturing System BAB 13. Rekayasa Mutu',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43924,48074,'a','Teknik -- Industri',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43925,48078,'a','9786026947802',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43926,48079,'0','010-1025001319',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43927,48080,'a','id',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43928,48081,'a','741.6',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43929,48082,'a','741.6 KUS d',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43930,48083,'a','Endik Kuswantoro, S.Kom,MT',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43931,48084,'a','Dasar Desain Grafis : Untuk SMK / MAK Kelas X',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43932,48085,'a','Malang',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43933,48085,'b','PT. Latif Kitto Mahesa',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43934,48085,'c','2018',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43935,48086,'a','xii, 328hlm; 25cm',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43936,48087,'a','Desaigner -- Desain -- Grafis',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43937,48091,'a','979-410-019-6',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43938,48092,'0','010-1025001320',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43939,48093,'a','id',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43940,48094,'a','745.5',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43941,48095,'a','745.5 Sar s',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43942,48096,'a','Saraswati',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43943,48097,'a','Seni Anyaman Hati Batang Rotan (Pitrit)',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43944,48098,'a','1',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43945,48099,'a','Jakarta',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43946,48099,'b','Bhrata Karya Aksara',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(43947,48099,'c','1989',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL