khir dengan Bluebell. Mereka melakukan perjalanan selama 30 hari keliling United Kingdom. Selama ini mereka adalah \"duo traveller\" yang lebih banyak berpetualang diluar. Kinilah saatnya mereka menjelajahi \"rumah sendiri\". Perjalanan sebulan ini menempuhi 10 ribu mil, melintasi Inggris, Skotlandia, Wale, hingga Irlandia Utara. Arie menuliskan pengalaman tersebut dengan detail dan intens, seolah kita bisa merasakan sendiri, embusan angin Britania yang menampar pipi, saat Bluebell melaju. NIKMATI KISAH-KISAH DALAM CATATAN INI, DAN RASAKAN KESERUAN PENGALAMAN MEREKA BERTIGA !',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46956,51365,'a','novel -- Travel',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46957,51369,'a','97985811050',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46958,51370,'0','010-1025001556',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46959,51371,'a','id',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46960,51372,'a','808.02',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46961,51373,'a','808.02 SUM c.',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46962,51374,'a','Jakob Sumardjo',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46963,51375,'a','Catatan Kecil Tentang Menulis Cerpen',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46964,51376,'a','1 cet.4',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46965,51377,'a','yogyakarta',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46966,51377,'b','Pustaka Pelajar',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46967,51377,'c','2007',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46968,51378,'a','v, xiv; 239 hlm; 12,1 x 19,5 cm',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46969,51379,'a','Pengetahuan',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46970,51383,'0','010-1025001557',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46971,51384,'a','id',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46972,51385,'a','NONE',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46973,51386,'a','FIK Bac l.',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46974,51387,'a','Sutardji Calzoum Bachri',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46975,51388,'a','Yahyono',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46976,51389,'a','Lumba - Lumba Ungu',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(46